# | Advantech ADAM-6017 — 8-Channel Analog Input / 2-Channel Digital Output (Ethernet/Modbus TCP)
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-6000-modbus.pdf (Appendix B.2)
# | - 8-channel analog input + 2 digital outputs; range configurable per channel via type code.
# | - Modbus TCP (Ethernet), unit identifier = 1.
# | - FC01 addr 16-17 (00017-00018): DO value ch 0-1 (R/W).
# | - FC03 addr 0-7: AI raw value ch 0-7 (u16, 0-65535=full scale) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 8: AI average (u16) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 30-31..45-46: AI float value ch 0-7 (f32 IEEE754, 2 regs each) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 47-48: AI float average (f32) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 100,102..114: AI status ch 0-7 (u16 at odd addr; bit0=fail, bit1=over, bit2=under, bit3=burnout) (R).
# | - FC03 addr 200-207: Type code ch 0-7 (R/W); addr 208: avg type code (Read).
# | - FC03 addr 210-211: Module Name 1-2 (R).
# | - FC03 addr 220: AI channel enable all (R/W).
